- Update database record (REPLACE)
- Result: One PDF in Vault (current behavior)

**If "Keep Both":**

- Keep old PDF as-is
- Generate new PDF with version suffix: `Invoice-27/02/2026-0001_v2.pdf`
- Create new database record
- Result: Both PDFs visible in Vault

