---

## **The Fix Pattern:**

Kotlin

```
// ❌ WRONG - No key or duplicate keys
LazyColumn {
    items(invoiceItems) { item ->
        InvoiceItemRow(item)
    }
}

// ✅ RIGHT - Unique key for each item
LazyColumn {
    items(invoiceItems, key = { it.id }) { item ->
        InvoiceItemRow(item)
    }
}
```

