Make sure `FileProvider` is properly configured in `AndroidManifest.xml`:

XML

```
<provider
    android:name="androidx.core.content.FileProvider"
    android:authorities="com.emul8r.bizap.fileprovider"
    android:exported="false">
    <meta-data
