|Refresh|Up-to-date analytics|Numbers keep growing|Clear & replace, not append|
|No Data Added|No change|Value increases each click||

---

**Bottom Line:**  
You have a classic “not idempotent” analytics snapshot bug—fix by clearing or replacing (not appending) your snapshot table on each refresh, so your charts/numbers always match reality.

