```
// Instead of this (hardcoded)
// backgroundColor = Color.Green
// Use this:
backgroundColor = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary
```

4. **Test All Presets:**
    - After refactoring, toggling any of the theme presets should change _all_ major UI colors, not just headers/cards.

